There are still one or two dangers to be considered: after
reading the scroll, you might not be able to change from the
expendable weapon or armor, and you might have forgotten all the
stuff you'd already learned.  You might also find yourself
encumbered with a iron ball.  Or find yourself in an unfriendly
crowd.

